Rule30WhitePulseResearch\\n\\n/-- A nonzero encoded strip contains a black \
cell within its width. -/\\ntheorem enc_nonzero_has_black {x : Int \
\[RightArrow] Bool} {K t : Nat} {i : Int} {v : Nat}\\n    (he : \
Rule30FiniteStripsResearch.Enc x K t i v) (hv : v \[NotEqual] 0) :\\n    \
