SixTailEndpoint111101Checks0Research -/\\nnamespace \
Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30SixTailEndpointResearch.C111101\\nopen \
Rule30StripCertificates Rule30BackwardTubeResearch\\nset_option maxRecDepth \
100000\\nset_option maxHeartbeats 0\\ntheorem Zzero : Z.testBit 0 = true := \
by decide +kernel\\ntheorem Zfixed : image K false Z = Z := by decide +kernel\
\\ntheorem p0 : preCheck K (tail.getD 0 false) (P 0) (P 1) = true := by \
decide +kernel\\nend \
Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30SixTailEndpointResearch.C111101\\n\\n/- \
