 CellID->1657269721,ExpressionUUID->"034d641c-5834-e412-3173-7e4659c6cf78"],

Cell["\<\
This is not a classification of every tail or every periodic word. No \
statement about equal limiting frequencies or computational lower bounds is \
proved. The notebook headline is the sixteen-core partial result; the \
complete length-at-most-six result is a separate modular catalog theorem.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1140508347,ExpressionUUID->"52ce4f6a-032d-a48b-02f6-6734b6d90ed1"],

